# The search over Home (search.mbt; the Android app's SearchMotionTest): the list pulled down to its field, the field
# tapped (it comes up to the top as 取消 comes in, the list and the bars going away), words typed (what they find, the
# words' strokes drawn in), then 取消 (the field back into the list).
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 600
drag 195 300 0 300 300
wait 900
tap 搜索全部内容
wait 900
type 签名
wait 2500
tap 取消
wait 1200
